TIKI
// HZM coop - DISMEMBERMENT PHASE 0 (decapitation): the bloody NECK-STUMP CAP the engine attaches
// (game.dll Sentient::CoopGoreTryDecapitate) at the decapitated corpse's "Bip01 Neck" tag, so the open
// neck hole left by nodraw-ing the "head" surface is filled with a wet red mass instead of a gap.
//
// Mesh is the retail crossed-quad xbeam (models/fx/xbeam.skd - "an x which is 1 unit in all dimensions",
// the same donor coop_wound1.tik uses) so the cap reads from any viewing angle without needing orientation
// control. Shader coop_stump (scripts/coop_blood.shader) is the solid #150200 blood blob (reuses the
// coop_bloodpool sprite, cull none) - NEVER stock red. At scale 3.0 the cap is ~6 units across, roughly a
// neck's width. It attaches as a child of the corpse, so it rides the ragdoll 1:1 and is EV_Removed with
// the body; it replicates to all clients + late joiners via entityState.parent/tag_num.
//
// BETTER ART (future): a shallow bloody disc/cone authored to the neck cross-section (bug-535 bone-local
// orientation) sits flush across all head skds; the crossed-quad cap is the cheap MVP stand-in.
setup
{
	scale 3.0
	path models/fx/xbeam
	skelmodel xbeam.skd
	surface all shader coop_stump
}
animations
{
	idle xbeam.skc
}
